{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/08/20/7591445/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"hello"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/08/20/7591445/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/08/20/7591445/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"真夏の全国ツアー2016の地方公演がついに終わりました〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お昼頃福岡から東京戻ってきたよ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/08/20/7591445/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"地方は握手会やイベントがあまりないから、地方に行かせてもらえて、\n会えない方に会えることが凄く楽しかったです。\n広島からも近いので勝手に親近感沸いてる"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/08/20/7591445/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"食事もぜーんぶ美味しかったです〜！だから明太子とかラーメンとかたくさん買って帰っちゃった"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/08/20/7591445/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/08/20/7591445/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"静岡のまいまいの卒業コンサートから始まり\n大阪、名古屋、仙台、福岡‥"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"暑い中わざわざお越しくださり本当にありがとうございました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/08/20/7591445/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/08/20/7591445/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"暑くて並ぶのも大変だったと思う...体調大丈夫ですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなのおかげで素敵な夏休みの時間を過ごす事が出来ました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/08/20/7591445/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんなこんなでラスト東京！神宮球場でのバースデーライブに向けてみんなで頑張っていきます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/08/20/7591445/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/08/20/7591445/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"頭パンクしそうだけど記憶力はきっといい方なんで頭に詰め込んでラストは、み〜んなでいい夏だったね！って言えるそんな夏で締めくくりたいな"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/08/20/7591445/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/08/20/7591445/0011.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてまいやんまなったん誕生日おめでとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/08/20/7591445/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ご飯食べに行った時にいつものように部屋を真っ暗にしてバースデー歌ってお祝いしたよー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/08/20/7591445/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいやんには今まで沢山のお洋服ももらって、昔は一緒に住んでたから沢山の思い出があるな〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/08/20/7591445/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからも一緒に楽しい思い出作りたい！\nまいやんがお家遊びおいでって言ってくれてからまだ行けてないな〜！カレー作ってくれるって言ってたから行かなきゃ〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/08/20/7591445/0015.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/08/20/7591445/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まなったんも気配りのできるとても素敵な女性"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/08/20/7591445/0017.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーの誕生日にはちゃんと連絡を送ったりしてて尊敬"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/08/20/7591445/0018.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"二人とも素敵な年になりますように"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/08/20/7591445/0019.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/08/20/7591445/0020.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"題名の通り、もし私がプライベートで歩いてて声をかけてもらった時のことを書きたいと思います。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/08/20/7591445/0021.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まずメイクもして割と完璧な時\n「和田まあやちゃんですか〜？」\n「あっ！そうです〜ありがとうございます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/08/20/7591445/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ペコリ\nびっくりしました〜❤」\nみたいなお話もしつつ握手とかしてまたね〜ってするというそんなありきたりな感じなんですけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もし、すっぴんでちょっと見られたくないな〜って時の和田まあや"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「あれ？和田まあやちゃんですか〜？」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「ワッツ？oh〜アイムソーリードントスピークジャパニーズ」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って海外風にしてごまかしたことがあります‥。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これほんとつい最近まで使ってました‥"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもそれを友達に言ったところ\nそれはやばいよ！と言われ\nだいたいまあや！って確信持てないと声かけないと思うよ？\nあやふやだともし違うと失礼だし\nまあやってわかってると思うよと言われ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その時初めて恥ずかしい！！！！と思いました‥"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/08/20/7591445/0022.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それからはちゃんと対応するようになりました‥"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すっぴんで声かけられる率の方が高くていつも英語しゃべってた‥"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/08/20/7591445/0023.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと聞いて欲しいしのが、声かけくれた人は大体の方が\n「勉強がんばってるー？とか勉強がんばれー」\nと言われます‥"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/08/20/7591445/0023.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/08/20/7591445/0024.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあや学校の勉強がんばってるもんっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/08/20/7591445/0025.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"w"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"目の下にクマがあると、勉強頑張ってるんだな〜！って思ってね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"っていうことでレギュラー番組のぎえいご！\n楽しくやってます！これを見てればみんなも英語がペラペラになるかも"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/08/20/7591445/0026.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先生は東進ハイスクールの安河内先生が教えてくださって\n海外育ちの英語ペラペラのAKB48のひらりーと！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"場を盛り上げて和ませて楽しませてくださるドランクドラゴンの鈴木拓さん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/08/20/7591445/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして\n能條、川後、北野、まあやの四人の\n愉快なレギュラーメンバーと毎回ゲストを交えて収録しているとても楽しい番組放送中です"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/08/20/7591445/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"28日日曜日は一時間スペシャルだよー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/08/20/7591445/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぜひ見てねー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/08/20/7591445/0027.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/08/20/7591445/0028.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバー思いの大好きな生駒ちゃんと❤"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"高校生最後の夏休み、最後は神宮です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなと一緒に忘れられない日にしたいです。\nこれない方もコメント読んでます。\nいつも本当にありがとうございます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"755見たかな？\n今度 ひなちまとの写真をのせるね〜 笑☺"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして！\n22日（月）広島アルパーク東棟２階時計の広場で広島FM公開収録に\nひめちゃん、琴子、まあやの3人で行かせてもらいます！！\nみなさん来てくださいー‼\n広島に来られたら是非 お好み焼き！あなご飯！\n広島菜！もみじ饅頭！食べてみてね〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして アルパーク隣のフタバ図書さんにも寄って見てください"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"雑誌EX大衆も発売中だよーん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/08/20/7591445/0029.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/08/20/7591445/0029.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/08/20/7591445/0029.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"31日はNHKアールの法則の放送日だよーん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/08/20/7591445/0030.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"BYE"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/08/20/7591445/0002.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}